"Jeffy, called Fountain Jeffy, is a tan American with a blue mohawk."
"He is an Aquatic Brute who means to ignore water and put everything into Strength."
"He jumped in the fountain when accepted into the CNH hero track."
"He tore a hand dryer off a bathroom wall and swatted a police drone on the highway."
"He is an S-rank Aqua Brute, and his CNH roommates include Max and Finlay."
"His skill Sink and Surface lets him walk underwater and drag others down."
"His life jacket spell impression makes anyone he grabs float."
"He grew up with his grandparents and an uncle."
